We use the following lemma in our derivation.
\begin{lemma}[\citet{singh2021analytic}]
\label{lem:matrix}
\begin{align}
    \frac{\partial \bm{A}\bm{X}\bm{B}}{\partial \bm{X}} = \bm{A}\otimes \bm{B}^\top
\end{align}
