\section{Conclusion}
% \vspace{-10px}

In this paper, we propose physically inspired symbolic regression to learn symbolic expressions of complex network dynamics from data.
Our method is based on neural dynamics to augment and denoise the trajectory of complex network, and then apply the coordinated genetic search to infer the symbolic expressions based on the dynamics reference from neural dynamics.
In the future, we plan to extend our method to learn the symbolic expression of more complex systems and apply it to more real-world applications. See limitations in \cref{app:lim}.



