    \centering
        \centering
        \includegraphics[width=0.9\textwidth]{Images/PreferredTypeOfApplicationStudentResident.png}


    \caption{Responses grouped by profession: medical students and resident surgeons. \\\\ The application types were defined as follows: \\\textbf{Standalone app:} A locally installed application requiring no internet connection. \\ \textbf{Accessible web portal:} A browser-based application usable without installation. \\ \textbf{Fully immersive app:} A VR/AR-based application offering an immersive learning experience.}
