\caption{An overview of the proposed VaN3Twin framework: ms-van3t high-level architecture with Sionna RT integration.} %The scheme also highlights, at a functional level, the message exchange that occurs between the mobility model and Vehicle Data Provider (VDP) of ms-van3t and Sionna RT, leveraging UDP sockets. The mobility model block includes all the ms-van3t modules that manage the positioning updates and the sensor simulation.}
\label{fig:ms-van3t-arch-Sionna}
