Given a process $p$ and $\mathL \subseteq \mathL_{BS}$, we define  $\mathL(p)=\{\varphi\in\mathL \mid p\models\varphi\}$. A simplification of the Hennessy-Milner theorem gives a modal characterization of bisimilarity over finite processes. An analogous result is true for every preorder examined in this paper.

