The ball was launched after a randomly selected time in the range of [1, \SI{2}{s}] following the execution of the Move policy.
The goal input for the pre-transition policy, Move policy, was also provided in the same manner as in the Move-to-Dribble evaluation. The Move-to-Trap transition occurred at the moment the ball was launched.








