To address the conceptual deficits of existing BDD frameworks discussed in \cref{sec:intro}, we developed a \mm{} for BDD, detailed in this section.
\cref{fig:bdd-overall} shows how this \mm{} builds upon the core BDD structure -- a \keyword{Scenario} comprising \keyword{Given}, \keyword{When}, and \keyword{Then} concepts -- and links the introduced concepts to various robotic domains.

