		b) In a typical scenario where quantization is performed only by devices owing to limited resources and a high number of devices, and where edge servers at each layer connect to higher-layer edge servers through ideal backhaul links that do not require quantization, i.e., \( q_i = 0, \forall i=2,\ldots,N \), a simplified convergence rate is derived and outlined in the following corollary.
