We can prove the VC if the minimum-weight decoder $f$ satisfies $P_f$: 
\begin{equation*}
P_f \triangleq \left(\sum_{i=1}^{7} x_i \leq \sum_{i=1}^{7} e_i\right) \bigwedge \left(\sum_{i=1}^{7} z_i \leq \sum_{i=1}^{7} e_i\right) \bigwedge \left(\bigwedge_{i=1}^{6}(r_i(\bs) = \bs_i)\right).
