The \dataset consists entirely of English questions, all newly collected from public authoritative mathematics websites, and presented in the format of multiple-choice questions. As illustrated in Table \ref{tab:statistic}, the average number of words in the English questions within \dataset is 25.81, with the maximum number of words in a question reaching 143. Figure \ref{fig:statistics} further elaborates on the distribution of word counts, highlighting the diverse patterns of the questions.
