\subsection{Details of Model Performance}
\label{sec:Details Performance}

\textbf{The Leaderboard on \dataset.} We present the visualization results of the $\text{Score}_{\text{average}}$ under the loose and strict metric in Figure~\ref{fig:619-leaderboard}, respectively. GPT-4o shows a significant lead under both metric, and LLaVA-NeXT-110B performs the best among open-source models. Impressively, InternVL-Chat-V1.5 and GLM-4V-9B achieved excellent scores, surpassing the closed-source model Qwen-VL-Max. Additionally, some recently proposed smaller models (such as Phi-3-Vision-4.2B, InternLM-XComposer2-VL-7B, and MiniCPM-LLaMA3-V 2.5) also demonstrated outstanding performance, suggesting that optimizing training methods might partially substitute for the performance gains typically achieved by increasing the parameter count.



% \chinese{我们在图x和图x中分别展示了在loose和strict两种判别标准下的score average的可视化结果。gpt4o在两种标准下均有大幅度的领先，并且LLaVA-NeXT-110B在开源模型当中的表现均是最好的。令人惊喜的是，InterVL-Chat-V1.5展现出了不错的分数，超越了闭源模型qwen-vl-max；而近期提出的一些较小的模型（Phi-3-Vision， internlm-xc2， minicpm）也同样呈现出亮眼的表现，说明训练方法的优化是可以一定程度上替代参数量的增加所带来的表现增强。}



\textbf{Detailed Performance of Four-Dimensional Metrics.} 
Figure~\ref{fig:main_strict_4metric} and Figure~\ref{fig:main_loose_4metric} display the specific performance of LMMs under both loose and strict metric across four metrics. Focusing on the \textit{IK} metric, GPT-4o has the fewest instances under both metric, indicating that GPT-4o has the best grasp of the knowledge concepts. Furthermore, for the \textit{IG} metric, we find that GPT-4o and GPT-4V have the highest exposure compared to other models. As discussed in the previous Section~\ref{sec:Metric}, \textit{IG} issues only arise after addressing \textit{IK} issues, which further indicates that GPT-4 is progressing to the next stage. Focusing on the \textit{CM} and \textit{RM} metrics, GPT-4o and GPT-4V continue to show significant leadership. Both models excel in the \textit{CM} metric, where the number of correctly answered multi-step problems and their corresponding sub-questions is significantly higher than that of other models. Additionally, comparing GPT-4o and GPT-4V under strict metric, GPT-4o consistently outperforms GPT-4V, aligning with the $\text{Score}_{\text{average}}$ results.


% \chinese{图1，图2展示了Lmms在loose和strict标准下的四维metric的具体表现。聚焦于IK指标，gpt-4o在两种标准下数量均为最少的，表明gpt-4o在知识点的掌握程度上是最好的。进一步的，在IG指标下，我们发现gpt-4o和gpt-4V相比其他模型暴露在这一问题中的数量是最多的，但如前文section Metrics’ Intrinsic Logic中所述，需要解决IK的问题之后才会暴露IG问题，也进一步表明gpt4已经逐步迈向了下一阶段。聚焦于CM与RM指标，gpt-4o与gpt-4V仍然展现出大幅度的领先，两个模型在cm指标下，即multi-step problem与其对应的子问题均回答正确的数量均显著领先于其他模型。此外，对比于gpt-4o与gpt-4V，在strict标准下，4o均领先于4V，与Score_average有着一致的体现。}





