\subsection{Specific Error Analysis}
\label{subapp:Error Analysis}

\begin{comment}
\chinese{
To delve into failure cases of models, we detailed four error types in table x. Furthermore, to facilitate a better understanding of each error type, we provide examples of each error type made by GPT-4o in Fig x. 由于一道题目的thought process中可能出现多种错误，a single logical error is enough to derail a much larger solution, 所以我们将推理步骤中出现的第一个错误视为关键错误并只将它纳入统计中。
knowledge error:对于一个特定的知识点，模型不清楚或者混淆了它，或误用其它知识点解题
reason error:运用知识点逐步解题的过程中，出现了推理错误 
visual error:视觉感知错误，错误地识别了图片中的图形或数字
hallucination:thought process中引入了不符合事实的因素，which is not mentioned in the context of the image or question.
}
