    \item \textbf{Evaluation:} We evaluate the proposed method on benchmark datasets for multi-dimensional data streams, comparing its performance against state-of-the-art adaptive windowing techniques, such as ADWIN~\cite{bifet2007learning} and deep learning-based methods~\cite{baig2019adaptive}.
    \item \textbf{Discussion of Challenges and Future Directions:} We highlight the challenges of applying reinforcement learning to this domain, such as handling high-dimensional state spaces and ensuring computational efficiency, and suggest avenues for future research.
