\textbf{Step 1}: 
%After model training is finished follows the \ac{fl} procedure, 
Each \ac{ue} uses the global model $\Theta^{*}$ and its own request history  to predict the next $n$ mini slots' content requests probability $\hat{i}_{u,f}^t$.

