    where $\hat \lambda_i$ is rayleigh estimation of $\hat{u}_{q+1}^i$, $\Pi=U_qU_q^\top $ for $U_q$ the orthonormal basis of $span\{u_q^1,u_q^2,\cdots,u_q^k\}$, and $\hat U_{i-1}=orth([ u_{q+1}^1, u_{q+1}^2,\cdots, u_{q+1}^{i-1}])$. Denote $\hat U^{all}_{q+1}=[\hat u_{q+1}^1,\hat u_{q+1}^2,\cdots,\hat u_{q+1}^i]$. 

    Note that $\hat U_{q+1}^{all}$ is only a rotation of $U_q$, and thus $\|V_2^\top  \hat U_{q+1}^{all}\|=\|V_2^\top U_q\|$. 

