Then 
$\myg\vdash_{\epsilon_1}\then{}{v}{\lambda^\epsilon x\type \sigma.e_1} \xrightarrow{0} \glocal{\epsilon}{e_1[v/x]}{\lambda^{\epsilon}x : \real.\,0}$.
and $\glocal{\epsilon}{e_1[v/x]}{\lambda^{\epsilon}x : \real.\,0}\type \sigma\etype\epsilon_1$.

