  \item %
  Suppose that $e$ has the form  $\then{}{v}{\lambda^{\epsilon_1} x\type \sigma.e_1}$.
 This is immediate from Lemma~\ref{Alem:ginc}, using the induction hypothesis. 
 %
 %
  %



  %
  %
  %
  %

  \item %

  Suppose that $e$ has the form $\glocal{\epsilon}{v}{\myg}$, for a value $v$. This case is immediate.


  %
